"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n## Review\nMaybe because it moved to a new, expanded location, there was less waiting than last time.  \nThere is no Catch Table system; you just order first at the kiosk, get a waiting number, and wait for your turn.  \n\nYou can add toppings, but I didn't add any separately because rice, noodles, and broth can be refilled indefinitely.  \nThe noodles have a slightly firm texture.  \nOf course, I added rice and ate it all, even the broth.  \n\nI hesitated after seeing the next table refilling broth and noodles, but I held back because I thought I would overeat.  \nNext time, I'll try the red broth too!\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n"